# GitHub CODEOWNERS for chrono-synth-deploy.
#
# Each rule maps a path pattern to the team(s) whose review is REQUIRED
# before the PR can merge. The compliance / supply-chain rules below are
# the GA SOC2 audit anchor: any change to a Kyverno policy, the
# compliance AppProject, or the policy ApplicationSet must be approved
# by the security-operators team. Argo CD's chrono-synth-compliance
# AppProject deliberately does not grant `applications, override`, so
# Git review is the only on-ramp for policy changes.
#
# IMPORTANT: GitHub CODEOWNERS uses LAST-MATCHING-RULE-WINS precedence.
# Specific compliance paths MUST appear after any broader rule that
# covers their parent directory; otherwise the broader rule overrides
# the security-operators claim. The lint-compliance.sh script asserts
# this ordering.

# Default — platform team owns everything not otherwise claimed.
*                                                               @wontlost-ltd/platform

# Broader rules first.
/argocd/projects/                                               @wontlost-ltd/platform @wontlost-ltd/security-operators
/argocd/install/                                                @wontlost-ltd/platform

# Production deployment manifests + Helm charts.
/k8s/overlays/prod/                                             @wontlost-ltd/platform @wontlost-ltd/sre
/helm/                                                          @wontlost-ltd/platform

# Compliance Kyverno policies + their ArgoCD wiring (MUST be last so
# they win over the broader /argocd/projects/ rule above).
/compliance/                                                    @wontlost-ltd/security-operators
/argocd/projects/chrono-synth-compliance.yaml                   @wontlost-ltd/security-operators
/argocd/applicationsets/chrono-synth-compliance.yaml            @wontlost-ltd/security-operators
/scripts/lint-compliance.sh                                     @wontlost-ltd/security-operators
# CODEOWNERS itself must be owned by security-operators — otherwise
# any code-owner could rewrite the audit anchor.
/.github/CODEOWNERS                                             @wontlost-ltd/security-operators
